<title>FRANCE: France to sell 22 to 24 bln Ffr of BTANs Thursday.</title>
<headline>France to sell 22 to 24 bln Ffr of BTANs Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>France is to offer between 22 and 24 billion francs of government bonds (BTANs) at its next scheduled auction on April 17, the Treasury said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Treasury will offer the current two- and five-year benchmark BTANs: the 4.75 percent April 12, 1999 BTAN and the 4.75 percent March 12, 2002 BTAN, the statement said.</p>
<p>The payment date for the two-year BTAN will be May 5 and May 12 for the five-year BTAN</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
</text>
